--------------------------------------------------------
 CTE Scan on x
   Output: x.a
   CTE x
     ->  Recursive Union
           ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*"
                 Output: "*VALUES*".column1
           ->  WorkTable Scan on x x_1
                 Output: (x_1.a || x_1.a)
                 Filter: (length((x_1.a || x_1.a)) < 5)
(9 rows)

